:"Cocktail Bars","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Tapas/Small Plates","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"iJepNTdQh-vOBoIzmx-Kmg","review_id":"8oVfz0eLDKYJqWHZj4Dhvw","date":"2010-06-05T16:14:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9507830142974854,"text_excerpt":"I'll admit, I have been avoiding Cure from the beginning, as it seemed like an uptight, overpriced yuppie bar. I finally set foot inside and realized I had been way off target. This place has an awesome drink selection, a classy yet relaxed vibe, and some amazing bartenders. Bonus: Happy hour (5-7pm) is $5 classic cocktails! Pro-tip: Go in, tell the bartender what kind of drink you are in the mood for, and have them mix you up something awesome. I have yet to be disappointed with this method!"},{"business_id":"iJepNTdQh-vOBoIzmx-Kmg","review_id":"QXBMoKc-_hJhiIgc8VGlOw","date":"2011-06-15T17:57:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9450055956840515,"text_excerpt":"Drinks are extremely well done, taste great, and you don't even know they're almost entirely liquor. The food was also good, especially the short rib \"debris\" sandwich which was amazing with great tasting meat and gruyere on nice pieces of toasted whole grain bread. They did a great job of adaptive reuse with the building and it looks great, although it is a little out-of-the-way up on Freret and not someplace I would walk to. Cure isn't cheap but honestly prices really aren't too high for an establishment and drinks like this - it's inline with high end places such as the Sazerac Bar downtown (but the drink options are better at Cure) and definitley cheaper than many similar bars elsewhe..."},{"business_id":"iJepNTdQh-vOBoIzmx-Kmg","review_id":"HeagRPqYCvtBC_9VREQ9Vw","date":"2010-10-03T19:27:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9435228705406189,"text_excerpt":"I finally had the opportunity to try out Cure. Very nice bar! I love the neighborhood its in. I don't get to go in the Feret neighborhood often, so it was definitely great. The inside is awesome. Great for friends to get together at one of their cozy tables and catch up. The drinks just as everyone says are fabulous, truly well crafted. They even have a happy hour with classic cocktails on it! You just can't go wrong with that"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iJepNTdQh-vOBoIzmx-Kmg","photo_id":"wbIfpvH-9crAEKue0iPRAg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/wbIfpvH-9crAEKue0iPRAg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8922117948532104},{"business_id":"iJepNTdQh-vOBoIzmx-Kmg","photo_id":"U8_3-X9CnoGnl7K16FXzZw","label":"inside","image_url":"